e 13S Mesonet        3.44 inches|Fishtrap Lake Gauge         3.01 inches|Virgie Gauge                    3.20 inches|Elkhorn City River Gauge    3.54 inches|Myra IFLOWS                   3.38 inches    |Virgie IFLOWS                  3.34 inches   |Beefhide IFLOWS              3.59 inches.', 'Running flood waters covered a portion of Highway 3406 at the bottom fork of Mayking.');
